module gunbc.instruments.ci_run_step_roster

// THE RUN-STEP ROSTER. The single enumeration of registered run-step targets -- the fold
// population of gunbc.instruments.roster_reach_inhabitance and the step-bound claim witnesses
// (test.claim.host.network_install_ci_witness, test.claim.namecheap_workflow_witness,
// test.claim.printer_workflow_binding_witness,
// test.claim.spark.spark_inspect_dropin_shape_witness). It lives on the instrument side, beside
// its readers: a production workflow emitter must never import this module, because reaching the
// roster means reaching every step module it enumerates -- the fan-in P5 of
// gunbc.plans.closure_consolidation dissolves ci_spec precisely to forbid. Moved verbatim from
// gunbc.ci.ci_spec when that module was dissolved.

